MAIN
MOVE TEMP 0 HALLOCATE 16
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 LS_Start
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 LS_Print
HSTORE TEMP 0 8 LS_Search
HSTORE TEMP 0 12 LS_Init
MOVE TEMP 1 HALLOCATE 0
MOVE TEMP 2 HALLOCATE 12
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 16
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 LS_Start
HSTORE TEMP 3 4 LS_Print
HSTORE TEMP 3 8 LS_Search
HSTORE TEMP 3 12 LS_Init
HSTORE TEMP 2 0 TEMP 3
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 0
MOVE TEMP 6 CALL TEMP 5 ( TEMP 2 10 ) 
PRINT TEMP 6
END
LS_Start [2]
BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 12
MOVE TEMP 6 CALL TEMP 5 ( TEMP 0 TEMP 1 ) 
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 6
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 4
MOVE TEMP 9 CALL TEMP 8 ( TEMP 0 ) 
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 9
PRINT 9999
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 8
MOVE TEMP 12 CALL TEMP 11 ( TEMP 0 8 ) 
PRINT TEMP 12
HLOAD TEMP 13 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 13 8
MOVE TEMP 15 CALL TEMP 14 ( TEMP 0 12 ) 
PRINT TEMP 15
HLOAD TEMP 16 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 17 TEMP 16 8
MOVE TEMP 18 CALL TEMP 17 ( TEMP 0 17 ) 
PRINT TEMP 18
HLOAD TEMP 19 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 20 TEMP 19 8
MOVE TEMP 21 CALL TEMP 20 ( TEMP 0 50 ) 
PRINT TEMP 21
RETURN 55
END
LS_Print [1]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 1 1
L0
NOOP
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 8
CJUMP LE TEMP 1 MINUS TEMP 2 1 L1
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 4 PLUS TEMP 3 PLUS TIMES TEMP 1 4 4
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 0
PRINT TEMP 5
MOVE TEMP 1 PLUS TEMP 1 1
JUMP L0
L1
NOOP
RETURN 0
END
LS_Search [2]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 1
MOVE TEMP 3 0
MOVE TEMP 4 0
L2
NOOP
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 0 8
CJUMP LE TEMP 2 MINUS TEMP 8 1 L3
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 10 PLUS TEMP 9 PLUS TIMES TEMP 2 4 4
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 6 PLUS TEMP 1 1
CJUMP LE TEMP 5 TEMP 1 L4
CJUMP NE TEMP 5 TEMP 1 L4
MOVE TEMP 12  1
JUMP L5
L4
NOOP
MOVE TEMP 12  0
L5
NOOP
CJUMP TEMP 12 L6
MOVE TEMP 7 0
JUMP L7
L6
NOOP
CJUMP LE TEMP 5 MINUS TEMP 6 1 L8
MOVE TEMP 13 0
JUMP L9
L8
NOOP
MOVE TEMP 13 1
L9
NOOP
CJUMP TEMP 13 L10
MOVE TEMP 7 0
JUMP L11
L10
NOOP
MOVE TEMP 3 1
MOVE TEMP 4 1
HLOAD TEMP 14 TEMP 0 8
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 14
L11
NOOP
L7
NOOP
MOVE TEMP 2 PLUS TEMP 2 1
JUMP L2
L3
NOOP
RETURN TEMP 4
END
LS_Init [2]
BEGIN
HSTORE TEMP 0 8 TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 6 HALLOCATE TIMES PLUS TEMP 1 1 4
HSTORE TEMP 6 0 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 6
MOVE TEMP 2 1
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 0 8
MOVE TEMP 3 PLUS TEMP 7 1
L12
NOOP
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 0 8
CJUMP LE TEMP 2 MINUS TEMP 8 1 L13
MOVE TEMP 4 TIMES 2 TEMP 2
MOVE TEMP 5 MINUS TEMP 3 3
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 0 4
MOVE TEMP 10 PLUS TEMP 9 PLUS TIMES TEMP 2 4 4
HSTORE TEMP 10 0 PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5
MOVE TEMP 2 PLUS TEMP 2 1
MOVE TEMP 3 MINUS TEMP 3 1
JUMP L12
L13
NOOP
RETURN 0
END
